<div class="wrap sec sec--tight prose">
  <h2 class="h2 h2--sm">What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you join the waitlist, you give us your email address, your trade, your state and your answers to two questions: which price fits you, and what you use for job changes now.</p>
  <h2 class="h2 h2--sm">Where it’s kept</h2>
  <p>The waitlist form is run by Tally (tally.so), which stores your answers for us. Tally’s own privacy policy covers how it handles them.</p>
  <h2 class="h2 h2--sm">What we use it for</h2>
  <p>We use it to email you when Jobchit opens and to decide what to build first. We don’t sell it or share it with anyone else.</p>
  <h2 class="h2 h2--sm">The rest of the site</h2>
  <p>The templates and other pages need no account and no email. This site sets no cookies of its own and runs no analytics.</p>
  <h2 class="h2 h2--sm">Having your entry removed</h2>
  <p>Email us at {% if site.contactEmail %}<a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>{% else %}[business email, added once TODO H5 is done]{% endif %} and we’ll delete your entry from the waitlist.</p>
</div>
